            "review_title": "Review at Ming Court Restaurant",
            "review_text": "BeHappy858\nHong Kong, China117 contributions\n0\nDisappointing...\nOct 2024 • Family\nI've had the pleasure of dining at this restaurant with my family on multiple occasions, consistently enjoying excellent service and satisfactory cuisine. However, our most recent visit was a stark disappointment. Although the servers maintained their usual attentiveness, the food quality plummeted.\n\nThe typically reliable roasted duck and pork were surprisingly tough and tasted stale, the congee lacked any discernible flavor, the beef was overcooked and bland, and even the dessert fell short, tasting more like yesterday's leftovers.\n\nThe drastic decline in culinary standards was shocking and left a lasting impression.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 13, 2024",
